<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0686_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hillary</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d love to do some more scrap\nprep and review with you...\rThat’s it!\nHow ’bout swappin’ numbers\fwith me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I’m lookin’ forward to talkin’\nagain. I’ll definitely give you a\fcall if anythin’ come up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you should listen when Teachers\nis talkin’ to you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You change your mind about\nswappin’ numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I’m pretty sure I just\nsaw you...\rIf you right nearby, don’t talk\nover the phone. Talk\fto me in person.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo!\rYou got ANOTHER zero on a test!\nYou don’t pay attention to NOTHIN’\fI say in class, do you?\fYou deadass think you can beat a\fBlock Boss with that kinda...\rHuh?\rYou ain’t Travis...\rOh my goodness! My bad!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I usually run {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rDon’t you love scrappin’ with your\nfave homie?\rBut it get kinda lonely just\nusin’ the same homie over and over.\rSometimes I like to walk with\nhomies I just caught.\rThat can be mad fun too, you know?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other day, I was scrappin’\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} on Route 15. People\fstopped to watch, and soon there was\fthis HUGE crowd!\fI got SO nervous...\rYou know, I’m used to talkin’ in front\nof a class of kids...\fbut scraps is somethin’ else.\rI just can’t get comfy scrappin’ in\nfront of a crowd!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...\nThis stay between us, right?\rThe other day, I was tryna catch a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rI messed up and threw out the\nwrong Hood Ball, and the\fhomie dipped.\rGood thing none of my students\nwas watchin’. But still, I was mad\fembarrassed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, you’d like to prep for\nscraps and do some review,\fwouldn’t you?\rWe shoulda another scrap!\rI’m always on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nI’ll be waitin’ for you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You remember you made plans\nwith me?\rWe said we was finna meet on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} and have a\fscrap, right? Don’t forget!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right... If you ask me which is\ncuter, my students or homies,\fI’mma have a hard time makin’\fthat call.\rCome to think of it, for a lotta kids,\ntheir first homie is the cutest one in\fthe world in their lil eyes.\rAnd ain’t nothin’ you can say to\nchange that.</language>
	</row>
</body>
